    "Kermit's Tremé Mother-in-Law Lounge (Tremé)": 'Trumpeter Kermit Ruffins\'s technicolor Tremé clubhouse, the old Ernie K-Doe lounge, where red beans simmer, the grill smokes out back, and brass and R&B fill a mural-covered room. Pure New Orleans neighborhood joy.',
