    'Cafe Petersborg (Indre By)': 'History seeps from the walls of this 1750s bodega on Bredgade, once the haunt of Russian sailors from St. Petersburg. Four intimate wood-raftered rooms, handwritten bills, and exceptional traditional Danish food at fair prices.',
