    "Kidd Squid Brewing Co. (Sag Harbor)": "Sag Harbor's craft brewery pairs an ever-rotating tap list with live music in its beer garden, plus a steady run of collaborations with local artists and businesses. The newest and most community-minded room on the live-music map.",
    "The Surf Lodge (Montauk)": "Montauk's most celebrated and most exclusive summer scene, with an outdoor stage on Fort Pond that has hosted Sofi Tukker, Bob Moses and Busta Rhymes. Sunset cocktails, lobster rolls and blue-chip musical guests.",
    "Guild Hall (East Hampton)": "Fresh from a major renovation, this East Hampton cultural landmark stages everything from the New York Philharmonic to intimate singer-songwriter nights. The most prestigious live-performance venue in the Hamptons.",
