      "A 7.1.4 system whose battery-powered surround speakers detach from the bar, so true rear channels need no outlets or wires. RTINGS' mid-range pick and SoundGuys' Atmos favorite; buyers say it fills the room with Dolby Atmos sound and call it good value.",
    'CANVAS HiFi':
      "A premium soundbase that sits under the TV like furniture and earned StereoNET's Audiophile's Choice award for 2026. At $4,499 it is the most expensive pick in the field, aimed at listeners who want genuine hi-fi performance from a single cabinet.",
    'Sony HT-S100F':
      "The budget-class leader: a simple 2.0 bar with a bass reflex speaker that What Hi-Fi, Tom's Guide, and TechRadar all crown the best sub-$100 upgrade over TV speakers. Nearly 9,000 Amazon buyers praise the one-cable optical setup and the value.",
