      "A Lockhart institution dating to 1900, no-sauce-no-forks tradition, one of the original Texas meat markets and a Southern Living honoree in the barbecue capital of Lockhart.",
    'Redbird BBQ (Port Neches)':
      "Texas Monthly's number four, a Southeast Texas surprise in Port Neches turning out exceptional brisket on a Thursday-to-Saturday schedule far from the usual barbecue belt.",
